e of the best simulation games: begin constructing your dream world\n*Enjoy the visual and sound effects.\n*Build your own construction", "short_description": "You have a huge warehouse at your disposal. there are small remarkable and at the same time unusual objects. Using them you can try to build something original and phenomenal"}]}, "developer_name": "livbogdan", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://livbogdan.wixsite.com/licenggames/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "livbogdan", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://livbogdan.wixsite.com/licenggames/kubikos", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1725996564472128"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ART_CREATIVITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24685175144430220"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570299_273231374476615_3780854769626762337_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i-8rypCeni0Q7kNvwH-CHr0&_nc_oc=AdoQ09xv4USB4Io5XuOCgggitU3yQBCSxSPUq2865FJqD8-njJrpoqRtjGWby7IC7Ik&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afw7eQRT8aRNUqstmnjCXXRZ--0_-zHnVGzoFhk1VFRgIQ&oe=69C684C5"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "KUBIKOS", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}